Integration with Existing QGuard Helix Modules

The Quantum Intelligence Engine must consume and enrich data from existing modules rather than duplicate functionality.

Quantum Readiness Assessment Engine → Uses discovered cryptographic assets and readiness scores to generate optimization recommendations.
Migration Planner → Refines migration plans using real-time telemetry, hardware capabilities, and business policies.
Migration Sandbox → Executes benchmark scenarios, validates PQC configurations, and feeds performance results back into the recommendation engine.
Live Migration Ops → Applies approved policies, monitors deployment health, and supports rollback based on live telemetry.
Scanner → Supplies algorithm inventories, vulnerable assets, and quantum risk findings to the intelligence engine.
Threat Intelligence → Influences recommendations based on emerging PQC vulnerabilities, advisories, and threat campaigns.
Harvest Now, Decrypt Later Dashboard → Correlates high-value assets with adaptive PQC recommendations to prioritize protection.
QGuard Messaging → Applies handshake optimization, crypto agility, and secure session management recommendations.
Quantum Vault → Optimizes encryption policies, key management strategies, and hardware acceleration where applicable.
